{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "1a1e19a9-7488-8a8b-a6c6-e4468876d998",
  "created_at": "2026-02-05T12:52:20-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Finance",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Angela Cardillo",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Luis Barros",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-05T12:50:30-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Finance department, this is Luis. How can I help?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-05T12:50:34-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi Luis. Yeah, I got a parking ticket this morning, overnight parking, and I was parked in front of my own house. Wicked annoying."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-05T12:50:43-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "In front of your own house. Okay. Is it a street where overnight parking is restricted?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-05T12:50:49-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Apparently. I've lived here my whole life, never had a problem, and now I come out and there's a ticket under the wiper. So how do I get a resident permit so this doesn't happen again?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-05T12:51:01-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The permit goes through a separate application. You'd need proof you live there, like your license and your registration with the address on it. I can have you pick up the form here or get it from the city website."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-05T12:51:15-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, I'll stop in. And the ticket itself, this is the first one I've ever gotten. Is there any way they waive it? Like a first-time thing?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-05T12:51:24-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "There's a review process where you can ask for it to be looked at. I can't promise what they'll say. You'd write down what happened and send it with the ticket number. I can give you the details when you come in."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-05T12:51:38-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Fine. It's not like I was dumped on the street for a week. It was one night."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-05T12:51:44-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. Hang on to the ticket, it has the number you need."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-05T12:51:49-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it right here. Um, so are you gonna be nice to me when I come in? Is it a warm office or am I walking into the ice box?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-05T12:51:59-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "[pause] Well, the heat works. As for me, I'm dry, but I'm harmless. Bring the ID and the registration and we'll get you started."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-05T12:52:08-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, that's fair. I'll come by this afternoon, maybe after two."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-05T12:52:12-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "We're here. Ask for me at the counter."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-05T12:52:15-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Alright, thanks Luis. See you later."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-05T12:52:18-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Take care."
    }
  ],
